wered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n          风味：覆盆子、蔓越莓、红布林、葡萄柚\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n          Raspberry, Cranberry, Red plum, Grapefruit\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;text-indent: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n           这款Tabi有之前传统处理的柑橘调性，像柠檬、葡萄柚，但可能是热冲击的作用它的红色莓果调性比传统处理的更为的凸显，入口就能感受到一些覆盆子的莓果香气，酸质整体是红色莓果与红色的柑橘类水果复合，很酸甜爽口，中后段会有一个很特别的香气，有小伙伴说像粽叶～（这个豆子风味的特征可能会有微调，我Ikawa曾经测了两次样，第一次Loring打出来的有差异，后来老王要求又打了一锅，后面还会继续跟踪调整，是一个硬茬）\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n  