/span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;text-indent: 8px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Tabi\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Tabi是哥伦比亚咖啡研究机构CENICAFE内部研发并推广的一个改良品种，取名于当地土著部落的语言，意为“好”。从1961年开始到2002年正式推出历时40余年。Tabi是人工杂交Typica, Bourbon和Timor Hybrid后得到的优良品种，其中最显著的特征是对叶锈病的抵抗力极强。这也是Orlando像慧兰大部分农民一样选择种植Tabi的原因。Tabi品种还有一个优势是沿袭了铁皮卡和波旁的优质杯品表现，可以高密度种植且适应高海拔，这对大多数种植条件一般的农户来说是一个优势品种。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, system-ui, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: justify;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Tabi的传统水洗和蜜处理出来的豆子也是偏像红色莓果、核果和红芯的柚子的果香和果酸，而经过有氧发酵和热冲击的的水洗出来的这个批次相比传统处理莓果调性会更为具象，同时酸质的延展性会更为细腻一些，甚至会觉得层次感上升了，触感既绵密又柔软～甚至还会带一丢丢桂花香气\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R3sV1y8LpGdyjCnQ0XTUnMI0MKj8cBE72ouzWC00Kicywia9pOzeVy5lhz1XIOQjH0xJHjico3ShXog/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;text-indent: 8px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n           Tabi的树型特别的优雅，对称的枝条与干净均匀的果簇间隔\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPCTLH62GskxuO0rAsZQUV7tR7BdyJ2EaOvj99todDAUEFvy4RghMyLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: center;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于El Diviso\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          El Diviso位于慧兰的Pitalito镇，庄园的主人Jose Uribe Lasso为了远离暴力的生活环境，从娜玲珑搬到了Pitalito，于2000年初购得了El Diviso，开始新的生活篇章。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          选择慧兰，是因为肥沃的土壤与健康多样的生态环境，给了Jose信心，只要努力，种咖啡或者其它任何作物都可以很好的生活下去。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2Dy1ogV3EicAtqVKT2jHbznuZLDXibBicYXvIGkykDHJyr8dbEcB0wqMa3Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2D3NDqUbVLLeLngOsichzP8ZXCvokHYudop0JdxkBc9yribul4B8NYUrwA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: justify;\">\n          庄园现在由3兄弟打理, 年长的Jhoan负责种植管理，Nestor负责整体运营，最年幼的Adrian负责处理以及一些市场工作；现在庄园里有种植的品种有Gesha、Java、Red bourbon、Pink bourbon、Sidra、Tabi、Colombia、Papayo、Ombligon、Chiroso和Bourbon Aji等品种，还有一些品种会有自然变异的黄色品种。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2Dia7P2zkvC3VvqnWJ5L1icUiaqlMZQ5c3ib3WJV3TnUKdT9YUbSdJE6bkUw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: left;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2DdTKSib6gFXDdKdLFvhfFPsuFTEpMHkqMgIN6OXG8zqiblTkSduG1WPCA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: left;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          另外，Diviso还有两个战略合作的农场Zarza与Las Flores，或者说他们是一个大集团，共享所有的处理经验与同样的处理设备配置，各自打理自己的农场与采收处理，最终对外的产品销售打个字的农场名字品牌化。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R3sV1y8LpGdyjCnQ0XTUnMNpnNZ1uKWABglpCkypc2Xw9ZZiayB3Ktskakic9DRwB4s68b7ead1kEQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于这个批次的处理方式\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"width: 577.421875px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: justify;\">\n            鲜果采收后用浮选，漂出浮果和杂质\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: justify;\">\n            浮选后，取出鲜果，手选去除瑕疵果和一些未熟或过熟的果子\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: justify;\">\n            挑选后的果子在发酵桶中静置48小时氧化（有氧发酵）\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: justify;\">\n            第一阶段的有氧发酵结束后，脱皮后放入发酵罐中进行48小时的厌氧发酵\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: justify;'>\n            厌氧发酵结束后取出咖啡豆，进行热冲击（50-60摄氏度的热水浸泡清洗豆子2分钟）\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: justify;'>\n</span>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: justify;'>\n            热冲击结束后，将咖啡豆转移到\n           </span>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: justify;'>\n            庄园自己定制的干燥箱（无外界热源，完全利用内置的咖啡豆/果自身热量通过循环气流来干燥）里干燥12小时，再转移到遮荫晒场干燥15天完成干燥\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          关于热冲击\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在哥伦期间，我了解到的热冲击有两种方式\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"width: 577.421875px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n           高温的热冲击，80摄氏度以上，需要更为强大高效的热水器（GP92）或者类似锅炉形式（核桃树）保证大量且高温的热水，会比较短的时间，30秒到2分钟之间\n          </p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n           中高温的热冲击，50-60摄氏度，类似我们家用的燃气热水器（Diviso/Flores/Zarza)，相对长的时间，20分钟左右或者更久\n          </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          热冲击的作用（逻辑）\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"width: 577.421875px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n           杀菌：高温的热冲击，可能会有一定的杀菌作用，但由于时间短，以食品的灭菌惯例来说，以及在实际操作时大量的咖啡果的成规模的浸泡方式和容器来说，可能它的杀菌作用更多的是比较表面的清洁效果\n          </section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          改变果皮果肉果胶的细胞壁结构，这个是可能的，在一些研究文献里也有提到，高温是能够带来咖啡果的物理结构变化，而果皮果肉和果胶的这个结构变化又会给带来后续的发酵过程带来新的变量：1-如果是脱皮的，那么果皮脱除时就能更高效的“出液”（果胶的粘液，里面可都是好东西，核桃树就是这么实践并验证出来应用在产品上的）；2-不脱皮，那么后面发酵时微生菌也会更可能高效的去触及到这些”好东西“吃掉它们，代谢出来我们需要的一些”好东西“（酯类/醇类芳香物质或者前驱物质）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我的一些切身体验\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"width: 577.421875px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            我蒸过橘子，发现蒸出来的橘子的那个香气和甜感跟新鲜的差别很大，好像更浓郁的柑橘香气，更甜，酸度反而感受到的变弱了\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            我在Diviso时，体验了一把辣椒波旁的热冲击，放好热水（水温就是伸手进去觉得会烫，但时能伸进去短暂的停留下）我们搅拌了一会把浮选做完，然后让果子自己泡着，过了几分钟我突然闻到了一股莓果的香气，好像新鲜的树莓或者就第一反应就是好多红色莓果的感觉，也是让我很惊奇；\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            上周我去吃火锅，涮了点鲜切的西红柿下去，过了一会一拎，西红柿的皮撕拉就华丽丽的脱落了，夹了个寂寞\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这些蛛丝马迹都让我觉得，热冲击真有可能是有大用的哦！让我们接下来两个月做一些实际的尝试验证下！\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TjNqBdicz3oAZsaaBeibxI6IDxj9dcJ7IvlWLQ3QAPg5r3jicJ5M22Kzm6MLQqs3nuf2jnKB4hWuvYg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          热冲击（热水是有燃气热水器加热管道送上来，50-60摄氏度）\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TjNqBdicz3oAZsaaBeibxI6Is7icg9UvpYHSaUzOic09ibHAichDL4BXXRticvDxiaVMMQia3jwabDdUfDGhA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          浮选后的手选，挑除一些浮选漏掉的瑕疵果\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TjNqBdicz3oAZsaaBeibxI6IAyOBNY7udQia5kxBBxkwgwPUc3dkRjzBDGiaJPF3CIbuUUu5IvibNpJlg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          厌氧发酵\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TjNqBdicz3oAZsaaBeibxI6IrsuW8nueYZV5g772Fr5NxlMl2LKWVSqToNwFIjw8fyPRqttUnO77QQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          晒棚晾晒\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
